Business logic:
- A missing slave StudySponsor row produces sponsor_entity UNKNOWN, remittance_target_date and filing_cutoff_date equal to laboratory_close_date, billing_decision PAUSED, exception_code SPONSOR_ACCOUNT_MISSING, and denomination_adjustment zero.
- Otherwise remittance_target_date is laboratory_close_date plus remittance_days. filing_cutoff_date is laboratory_close_date plus protocol_filing_days, with one additional day added when rush_assay is true.
- billing_decision is PAUSED when authorization_end is null or before laboratory_close_date. Otherwise it is INVESTIGATE when remittance_days exceeds protocol_filing_days, or when credit_profile contains RESTRICTED and rush_assay is true. It is CLEARED otherwise.
- Exception code precedence is AUTHORIZATION_INVALID, RESTRICTED_RUSH_ASSAY, REMITTANCE_EXCEEDS_FILING_WINDOW, then null.
- denomination_adjustment is zero when billing_denomination equals contracted_denomination; otherwise it is invoiced_charge multiplied by 0.025 and rounded to three decimal places. Equality is case-sensitive.

