Produce CTL2 for a Reformat/Map component that reads port 0 and writes port 0.

Input metadata, port 0:
<Metadata id="IberianReturnIn">
  <Record name="IberianReturnIn_Record" type="delimited">
    <Field name="return_reference" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="sales_route" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="invoice_issued_on" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="true"/>
    <Field name="return_logged_on" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="carrier_collected_on" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="warehouse_received_on" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="claim_category" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="returned_units" type="long" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="paid_value_eur" type="decimal" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="proof_of_purchase_present" type="boolean" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="quality_inspection_passed" type="boolean" nullable="false"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

Output metadata, port 0:
<Metadata id="IberianReturnDecisionOut">
  <Record name="IberianReturnDecisionOut_Record" type="delimited">
    <Field name="return_reference" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="claim_category" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="days_since_invoice" type="long" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="carrier_transit_days" type="integer" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="refund_value_eur" type="decimal" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="handling_charge_eur" type="decimal" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="resolution" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="resolution_reason" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="requires_quality_audit" type="boolean" nullable="false"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

Business logic:
- days_since_invoice is the whole-day difference between return_logged_on and invoice_issued_on. When invoice_issued_on is null, or when return_logged_on precedes invoice_issued_on, use zero. carrier_transit_days is the inclusive date span from carrier_collected_on through warehouse_received_on; use zero when warehouse_received_on precedes carrier_collected_on.
- The Iberian consumer-return programme accepts only sales_route values beginning with ES- or PT-. If sales_route begins with neither prefix, set resolution to HOLD, resolution_reason to OUTSIDE_IBERIAN_RETURN_NETWORK, and set both monetary outputs to zero.
- Supported claim_category values are DEFECT, CHANGE_OF_MIND, and TRANSPORT_DAMAGE. For any other category, set resolution to REJECTED, resolution_reason to UNSUPPORTED_CLAIM_CATEGORY, and set both monetary outputs to zero.
- For supported categories in accepted Iberian routes, reject a record with carrier_transit_days equal to zero as REJECTED / INVALID_CARRIER_DATE_RANGE. Also reject it as REJECTED / INVALID_PAID_VALUE when paid_value_eur is less than or equal to zero. These checks occur before category-specific rules.
- For DEFECT claims, approve the full paid_value_eur with no handling charge when quality_inspection_passed is true or days_since_invoice is no greater than 730. Otherwise set resolution to PENDING, refund_value_eur and handling_charge_eur to zero, and resolution_reason to INSPECTION_OR_WARRANTY_REVIEW. If invoice_issued_on is null and quality_inspection_passed is false, this pending outcome applies.
- For CHANGE_OF_MIND claims, an invoice is mandatory. When invoice_issued_on is null or proof_of_purchase_present is false, set resolution to PENDING with reason PROOF_OF_PURCHASE_REQUIRED and both monetary outputs to zero. Otherwise, approve only when days_since_invoice is no greater than 14 and quality_inspection_passed is true. An approved change-of-mind return has refund_value_eur equal to 90 percent of paid_value_eur, handling_charge_eur equal to 10 percent of paid_value_eur, resolution APPROVED, and reason IBERIAN_COOLING_OFF_RETURN. If either the 14-day condition or inspection condition fails, reject it with reason CHANGE_OF_MIND_NOT_ELIGIBLE and zero monetary outputs.
- For TRANSPORT_DAMAGE claims, approve the full paid_value_eur with no handling charge when carrier_transit_days is no greater than 10 and quality_inspection_passed is true. Otherwise set resolution to PENDING with reason CARRIER_DAMAGE_INSPECTION_REQUIRED and zero monetary outputs. proof_of_purchase_present and invoice_issued_on do not block a transport-damage claim.
- Round refund_value_eur and handling_charge_eur to two decimal places. requires_quality_audit is true when returned_units exceeds 20, when a CHANGE_OF_MIND claim has days_since_invoice greater than 14, or whenever resolution is PENDING. Emit one record.

Implementation clarifications:
- Apply the sales_route prefix validation first. Then apply unsupported-category, invalid carrier-date-range, and invalid paid-value checks before evaluating a supported category's detailed rules.
- The ES- and PT- prefixes are case-sensitive. Examples of accepted routes include ES-MADRID, ES-VALENCIA, PT-LISBOA, and PT-PORTO.
- For every HOLD, REJECTED, or PENDING outcome, refund_value_eur and handling_charge_eur are zero unless a category rule explicitly states otherwise.
- quality_inspection_passed is used only for the category-specific inspection decisions. proof_of_purchase_present is required only for CHANGE_OF_MIND claims.

PROPOSED CTL2 CODE:
```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer transform() {
    $out.0.return_reference = $in.0.return_reference;
    $out.0.claim_category = $in.0.claim_category;

    long daysSinceInvoice = 0L;
    if (!isnull($in.0.invoice_issued_on)
        && dateDiff($in.0.return_logged_on, $in.0.invoice_issued_on, day) > 0L) {
        daysSinceInvoice = dateDiff($in.0.return_logged_on, $in.0.invoice_issued_on, day);
    }
    $out.0.days_since_invoice = daysSinceInvoice;

    integer carrierTransitDays = 0;
    if (dateDiff($in.0.warehouse_received_on, $in.0.carrier_collected_on, day) >= 0L) {
        carrierTransitDays = long2integer(
            dateDiff($in.0.warehouse_received_on, $in.0.carrier_collected_on, day) + 1L);
    }
    $out.0.carrier_transit_days = carrierTransitDays;

    boolean requiresQualityAudit = $in.0.returned_units > 20L;
    decimal refundValue = 0D;
    decimal handlingCharge = 0D;
    string resolution = "";
    string resolutionReason = "";

    if (!startsWith($in.0.sales_route, "ES-")
        && !startsWith($in.0.sales_route, "PT-")) {
        resolution = "HOLD";
        resolutionReason = "OUTSIDE_IBERIAN_RETURN_NETWORK";
    } else if ($in.0.claim_category != "DEFECT"
               && $in.0.claim_category != "CHANGE_OF_MIND"
               && $in.0.claim_category != "TRANSPORT_DAMAGE") {
        resolution = "REJECTED";
        resolutionReason = "UNSUPPORTED_CLAIM_CATEGORY";
    } else if (carrierTransitDays == 0) {
        resolution = "REJECTED";
        resolutionReason = "INVALID_CARRIER_DATE_RANGE";
    } else if ($in.0.paid_value_eur <= 0D) {
        resolution = "REJECTED";
        resolutionReason = "INVALID_PAID_VALUE";
    } else if ($in.0.claim_category == "DEFECT") {
        if ($in.0.quality_inspection_passed
            || daysSinceInvoice <= 730L) {
            resolution = "APPROVED";
            resolutionReason = "DEFECT_RETURN_ACCEPTED";
            refundValue = round($in.0.paid_value_eur, 2);
        } else {
            resolution = "PENDING";
            resolutionReason = "INSPECTION_OR_WARRANTY_REVIEW";
            requiresQualityAudit = true;
        }
    } else if ($in.0.claim_category == "CHANGE_OF_MIND") {
        if (isnull($in.0.invoice_issued_on)
            || !$in.0.proof_of_purchase_present) {
            resolution = "PENDING";
            resolutionReason = "PROOF_OF_PURCHASE_REQUIRED";
            requiresQualityAudit = true;
        } else if (daysSinceInvoice <= 14L
                   && $in.0.quality_inspection_passed) {
            resolution = "APPROVED";
            resolutionReason = "IBERIAN_COOLING_OFF_RETURN";
            refundValue = round($in.0.paid_value_eur * 0.90D, 2);
            handlingCharge = round($in.0.paid_value_eur * 0.10D, 2);
        } else {
            resolution = "REJECTED";
            resolutionReason = "CHANGE_OF_MIND_NOT_ELIGIBLE";
            if (daysSinceInvoice > 14L) {
                requiresQualityAudit = true;
            }
        }
    } else if ($in.0.claim_category == "TRANSPORT_DAMAGE") {
        if (carrierTransitDays <= 10
            && $in.0.quality_inspection_passed) {
            resolution = "APPROVED";
            resolutionReason = "TRANSPORT_DAMAGE_ACCEPTED";
            refundValue = round($in.0.paid_value_eur, 2);
        } else {
            resolution = "PENDING";
            resolutionReason = "CARRIER_DAMAGE_INSPECTION_REQUIRED";
            requiresQualityAudit = true;
        }
    }

    $out.0.refund_value_eur = refundValue;
    $out.0.handling_charge_eur = handlingCharge;
    $out.0.resolution = resolution;
    $out.0.resolution_reason = resolutionReason;
    $out.0.requires_quality_audit = requiresQualityAudit;
    return OK;
}
```

